---
import Button from '@components/ui/Button.astro';
---

<section data-testid="reflection" id="reflection" class="py-10 lg:py-14">
	<div class="rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 p-7 dark:bg-gray-900 lg:p-10">
		<p class="mb-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-orange">05 — Reflection</p>
		<h2 class="mb-6 font-monospace text-2xl text-black dark:text-white lg:text-4xl">What we learned</h2>

		<div class="mb-8 grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-3">
			<div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm dark:border-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-800">
				<p class="mb-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-orange">What worked</p>
				<p class="mb-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-black dark:text-white">A counterintuitive north star</p>
				<p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
					Grounding every decision in one specific finding — conversational fit matters more than food preference — gave the team a shared reference. Every label and feature could be evaluated against it.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm dark:border-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-800">
				<p class="mb-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-orange">What we'd do differently</p>
				<p class="mb-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-black dark:text-white">Broader pool, earlier metrics</p>
				<p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
					Participants skewed toward Chinese international students. A more diverse sample would surface different safety concerns. We'd also introduce SUS and task completion rates earlier.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm dark:border-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-800">
				<p class="mb-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-orange">What's next</p>
				<p class="mb-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-black dark:text-white">Matching, verification, empty states</p>
				<p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
					A matching algorithm for conversational style. Verified profiles for safety. An empty-state experience for newly created events with no joiners yet.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-4 border-t border-gray-200 pt-8 text-center dark:border-gray-700">
			<p class="text-base font-semibold text-black dark:text-white">View the full interactive prototype</p>
			<a href="https://www.figma.com/proto/GHEjNtXC88rwqjANMyj82r/PalUp?node-id=628-2444&t=9MffpE68rPn1Mh8K-1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
				<Button style={'primary'} size={'lg'} name="View Prototype">View Interactive Prototype →</Button>
			</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
